  "Date": "2026-09-28T23:54:58Z",
  "Message": "feat(verification): PASS 2 foundation — contracts, persistence, verdict engine\n\nLiTT Verification System Foundation (PASS 2, implementation lane).\n\nPersistence (migration 20260928120000):\n- 10 tables: verification_plans, verification_checks (+narration_satisfies),\n  verification_attempts, verification_evidence, verification_artifacts\n  (sha256 UNIQUE, content-addressed), verification_artifact_links,\n  verification_verdicts, verification_failures, verification_quarantine,\n  verification_policy_snapshots.\n- Every table links explicitly via action_run_id UUID -\u003e action_runs(id);\n  optional mission_run_id -\u003e mission_runs(id). No verification_runs,\n  no verification_events — lifecycle events ride the canonical\n  action_events spine (new verification.* types in ACTION_EVENT_TYPES).\n\nPackage src/lib/verification/:\n- contracts/ (Zod v4): evidence, plan, records, command. schemas/ (JSON\n  Schema 2020-12): evidence/verdict/adapter-manifest 1.0.0.\n- verdict/: pure engine — classifyEvidence (schema -\u003e stale -\u003e\n  tamper-evident sha256 hash seal -\u003e authority), evaluate-assertion,\n  detect-conflicts (authoritative conflicts =\u003e INCONCLUSIVE), decide-check\n  (8-step order), decide-plan (fail \u003e blocked \u003e inconclusive \u003e pass).\n- store/: VerificationStore port, in-memory impl (ordered emitted events,\n  deep-cloned reloads), Supabase impl (server-only, events via\n  appendActionEvent). Redaction BEFORE persist; schema-invalid evidence\n  is quarantined with an event, never fixed.\n- executors/: terminal-executor (real spawnSync, redacted outputs,\n  hash-sealed evidence drafts), build-executor (canonical identities).\n\nDoctrine enforced: unknown is never success; no-evidence =\u003e INCONCLUSIVE;\nnarration-only =\u003e INCONCLUSIVE; invalid evidence can never be resurrected.\n\nTests: 38 new (verdict-engine, store-events, redaction, integration —\nreal command -\u003e attempt -\u003e redacted evidence -\u003e artifact+hash -\u003e\naction_event -\u003e DB reload -\u003e deterministic verdict, run twice).",
