  "File": "src/app/api/media/generate-video/route.refunds.test.ts",
  "SymlinkFile": "",
  "Commit": "f1515af1f691786ad61b8411829bc8c19563ae5b",
  "Link": "https://github.com/LabsConnected/litlabs-website/blob/f1515af1f691786ad61b8411829bc8c19563ae5b/src/app/api/media/generate-video/route.refunds.test.ts#L74",
  "Entropy": 3.5216405,
  "Author": "LiTT",
  "Email": "litt@litlabs.net",
  "Date": "2026-09-24T20:48:13Z",
  "Message": "P1-3: airtight staged video BITS refunds (no debit kept on failed output)\n\nOption 1 from the P1-3 investigation: keep the debit-up-front flow, but make\nrefunds airtight at every pipeline stage via the durable generation_jobs\nrefund_status state machine (none -\u003e pending -\u003e refunded), with the wallet\nledger idempotency key as the exactly-once arbiter.\n\nHoles closed:\n- Submission-failure refund could throw and be silently lost -\u003e new\n  refundVideoCharge() retries boundedly and never throws; the outcome is\n  recorded on the row (pending) so a later retry completes it.\n- createVideoJob always stored charged:true and the row stored the full\n  cost even for billing-exempt requests -\u003e phantom refunds possible when\n  the exemption lapsed before polling. Now records charged:!exempt and\n  littBitsCharged:0, and refunds use charge-time truth (also fixes the\n  reverse: charged users who became exempt before polling were under-refunded).\n- Status routes 404'd (no refund ever) when the in-memory job was missing\n  (other instance / restart) -\u003e fall back to the durable generation_jobs row.\n- markVideoJobRefunded was set BEFORE the wallet call; a throw left the\n  flag set and the refund was never retried -\u003e wallet-first ordering with\n  persistent pending intent.\n- alibaba-status never marked the durable row failed on FAILED (stuck in\n  generating forever) -\u003e failGenerationJob with the refund outcome.\n- No durable anchor existed at submission stage -\u003e the queued row is now\n  created BEFORE the debit; if it cannot be recorded we fail without debiting.\n\nTests: 17 new vitest regression tests (route.refunds.test.ts) covering each\nstage: submission refund, transient/persistent wallet failure, pending\nrefill on retry, exempt phantom-credit exclusion, cross-instance fallback,\nexactly-once across polls, exemption-flip both directions, alibaba FAILED\nrow failure.",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "f1515af1f691786ad61b8411829bc8c19563ae5b:src/app/api/media/generate-video/route.refunds.test.ts:generic-api-key:74"
 },
