  "SymlinkFile": "",
  "Commit": "0108b8d6da83f0542c820220455ad1c3ad450cd9",
  "Link": "https://github.com/LabsConnected/litlabs-website/blob/0108b8d6da83f0542c820220455ad1c3ad450cd9/src/app/(app)/studio/components/StudioPreviewPanel.style-probe.test.tsx#L39",
  "Entropy": 3.8413284,
  "Author": "LiTT",
  "Email": "litt@litlabs.net",
  "Date": "2026-09-23T07:08:08Z",
  "Message": "fix(studio): prevent and detect the Tailwind v4 browser @import trap\n\nP0 from the 2026-09-23 North Shore acceptance re-run: the builder wrote a\nstatic index.html with a Google Fonts @import inside\n\u003cstyle type=\"text/tailwindcss\"\u003e. The Tailwind v4 browser build checks\nt.includes(\"@import\") and, finding it without tailwindcss, silently skips\nits default import — compiling ZERO utilities with no error. The preview\nrendered all content completely unstyled while the badge said\n'Preview ready'.\n\nThree layers:\n1. Lint gate — findTailwindImportTrap() + tailwindImportTrapMessage() in\n   patch-validation.ts, wired into validateFilesWriteInputs and\n   validateApplyPatchInputs. Rejects the trap pre-approval with a\n   regeneration directive (fonts via \u003clink\u003e, or add @import \"tailwindcss\"\n   first). Mirrors the build's case-sensitive @import check.\n2. Prompt guidance — STYLING CONTRACT in buildRuntimeContextBlock for\n   static frameworks: the exact blessed \u003chead\u003e pattern + the @import ban.\n3. Detection — the injected inspector script runs a style probe after\n   load (hidden element + getComputedStyle, polled 10s for async CDN);\n   StudioPreviewPanel flips the badge to amber 'Preview styling failed\n   to apply' when a Tailwind-intended page renders unstyled. Origin-checked\n   postMessage; resets on previewUrl change.\n\nRegression tests: 9 lint cases, 2 prompt-guidance cases, 2 inspector\nprotocol cases, 4 panel badge cases. tsc clean, eslint 0 errors.",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "0108b8d6da83f0542c820220455ad1c3ad450cd9:src/app/(app)/studio/components/StudioPreviewPanel.style-probe.test.tsx:generic-api-key:39"
 },
