  "Entropy": 3.697846,
  "Author": "Larry's LiTT",
  "Email": "highlife4real1989@gmail.com",
  "Date": "2026-09-21T23:55:17Z",
  "Message": "feat(studio): project secrets UI + API for Clerk keys\n\nAdds the write path for per-project secrets that PR #450's preview\nread path consumes:\n\n- SecretBroker: listProjectSecrets / getProjectSecretByName /\n  upsertProjectSecret / decryptValue (project-scoped, AES-256-GCM at rest)\n- API: GET+POST /api/studio-projects/[projectId]/secrets (metadata only,\n  never values; POST rate-limited 30/hr) and DELETE\n  /api/studio-projects/[projectId]/secrets/[secretId]; owner-only via\n  getProject; save/delete nudges the preview via ensure-env so a running\n  preview restarts only when the resolved Clerk env actually changed\n- StudioSecretsPanel: paste the two Clerk keys, see masked fingerprints,\n  delete; mobile-friendly; reports whether the preview picked keys up\n- StudioPreviewPanel: key-icon toolbar toggle + 'Add Clerk keys' CTA in\n  the auth-config error state (the copy already pointed here)\n\nTests: 32 new (broker encryption/round-trip/scope, route auth/validation/\nrate-limit/no-leak, validation+fingerprint unit).",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "32534346dbb2a283c1197a980f107728ae0842c8:src/lib/terminal-v1/__tests__/secret-broker.test.ts:stripe-access-token:151"
 },
