  "Date": "2026-09-21T07:30:44Z",
  "Message": "fix: isolate preview workspace from production auth/env\n\n- Strip auth/forwarding headers before proxy sends to workspace\n- Prevent Clerk redirect escape by detecting out-of-scope redirects\n- Use an env allowlist for preview processes\n- Add regression tests for header/env/redirect isolation\n\nFixes the preview security boundary so terminal-server secrets and\nproduction auth context are not inherited by workspace processes.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
