  "Link": "https://github.com/LabsConnected/litlabs-website/blob/f7597864d070fa9d92492ca9648478cd23188999/src/lib/litt-intelligence/browser-billing.test.ts#L371",
  "Entropy": 3.5068905,
  "Author": "Laid-Back-89",
  "Email": "highlife4real1989@gmail.com",
  "Date": "2026-09-19T02:58:46Z",
  "Message": "feat(agent-browser): Phase 4 — BITS metering + abuse caps (#414)\n\nProvisional price BROWSER_MINUTE_BITS=45 (one spot, documented\nderivation: ~$0.018/min vendor cost at 1000 BITS/USD × 2.5 margin) +\nBROWSER_MODEL_CALL_BITS=10 for Stagehand model calls.\n\n- preflightBrowserStart on every session start (chat tool path +\n  REST route): fail closed on no-BITS, spend ceiling, 2-concurrent\n  session cap, 120-min/day quota, and an in-module start rate limit\n  covering the agent tool path.\n- Per-action gate: 101st action refused; quota crossed → session\n  pauses with a plain-English message, never a silent stall.\n- Burn accumulator: ceiling minutes from the FIRST successful action\n  (P1-3: provider failure = 0 BITS), + model-call surcharges only on\n  successful actions. Single settle on close/TTL with session-scoped\n  idempotency key (browser:settle:\u003csessionId\u003e).\n- Live burn on the status chip from the real accumulator via the\n  status probe; null when unknown (never a fake number).\n- Owner-only account gate kept. Exempt owners are metered but never\n  debited (video-route precedent).",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "f7597864d070fa9d92492ca9648478cd23188999:src/lib/litt-intelligence/browser-billing.test.ts:generic-api-key:371"
 },
