  "File": "src/lib/litt-intelligence/image-generate-auth.test.ts",
  "SymlinkFile": "",
  "Commit": "ac2120e043d77148b88ad7d3f453036fa181e991",
  "Link": "https://github.com/LabsConnected/litlabs-website/blob/ac2120e043d77148b88ad7d3f453036fa181e991/src/lib/litt-intelligence/image-generate-auth.test.ts#L50",
  "Entropy": 3.6178098,
  "Author": "LiTT",
  "Email": "litt@litlabs.net",
  "Date": "2026-09-18T03:37:29Z",
  "Message": "fix(studio): authenticate agent image.generate self-fetch (P0 approval-resume failure)\n\nApproving image.generate deterministically failed with 'The approved\nworkspace operation failed, so the project was not completed.' #371 fixed\nthe capability gate, but the approval gate pauses before execution, so the\nhandler was first exercised on the resume path — where handleImageGenerate\nself-fetched /api/media/generate with no Clerk session and was rejected\n(401). The model then re-requested the same approval: infinite loop.\n\n- tool-handlers.ts: handleImageGenerate now sends X-Internal-Service-Key +\n  X-Agent-User-Id (approving user from the workspace transport) when the\n  internal key is configured.\n- api/media/generate/route.ts: trusts the service-key + agent-user-id pair\n  as the caller (timing-safe compare); falls through to Clerk auth otherwise.\n- tool-registry.ts: image.generate no longer requires projectId in inputs\n  (the handler never used it and the model is never given it).\n- image-generate-auth.test.ts: 9 regression tests.",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "ac2120e043d77148b88ad7d3f453036fa181e991:src/lib/litt-intelligence/image-generate-auth.test.ts:generic-api-key:50"
 },
