  "Message": "fix: no fake Clerk fallback in production, clean temp artifacts\n\n- layout.tsx: log clear error when NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\n  is missing in production instead of silently using a placeholder.\n  The placeholder remains for dev/SSG only.\n- settings/page.tsx: minor settings cleanup\n- .env.example: add OPENAI_API_KEY documentation\n- .gitignore: ignore temp commit message files and source archives\n- Remove untracked temp files (COMMIT_MSG_DO_FIX*, litt-cli-source.tar.gz)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
