  "Message": "feat: remote inference provider — server-side model execution for paid users\n\nAdds the production customer boundary: a paying LiTT user with NO\nlocal OPENROUTER_API_KEY gets inference served by the terminal-server,\nwhich holds the provider key server-side. The CLI never sees the key.\n\nArchitecture:\n  CLI cockpit → RemoteModelProvider → POST /api/inference (SSE)\n    → terminal-server: verifyToken → checkEntitlement → runLiTTOperator\n    → SSE deltas back to CLI → recordUsage (ledger + coin debit)\n\nRemote is the DEFAULT for signed-in users. An accidental env var must\nNOT silently bypass BITS/subscription. Local BYOK requires explicit\nopt-in via LITT_LOCAL_MODE=1.\n\nServer-side:\n  - terminal-server/entitlement.ts — subscription + credits gate\n  - POST /api/inference SSE endpoint in server.ts\n  - supabase migration: litt_usage_ledger table\n\nCLI-side:\n  - remote-model-provider.ts — ModelProvider over SSE\n  - resolveProviderAdapterAsync — remote-first resolution order\n  - canUseAnyProvider — replaces hasOpenRouterKey gate\n  - auth-session.ts — getTerminalToken()\n  - controller.ts — all 3 paths use async resolver\n\nTests (all passing):\n  - remote-provider.test.ts — 17 tests (happy path + priority order)\n  - no-key-leak.test.ts — 5 tests (secret never in responses/logs/sessions)\n  - entitlement-denial.test.ts — 14 tests (402 surfaced cleanly)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "23dac8396ee1312604e43c25211fbc14de2c7d07:packages/litt-cli/src/__tests__/remote-provider.test.ts:generic-api-key:292"
 },
