  "Message": "feat(billing): B2.3 — migrate agent-billing to reservation flow\n\nRewrite agent-billing.ts to use canonical reserve_bits/settle_bits/\nrelease_bits RPCs instead of the non-existent reserve_credits/\nrefund_credits. Uses production agent_runs columns (agent_name, task,\nagent_mode, input/output jsonb) instead of columns that never existed\nin production (credits_charged, input_tokens, agent_instance_id, etc).\n\nUpdated Studio conversation message route to track reservationId and\npass it through to both successful and failed settlement paths.\n\nUpdated agent-billing tests to mock the new RPC contract (18 tests).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
