  "Date": "2026-08-04T06:19:30Z",
  "Message": "feat: extend media player, ground LiTT in runtime state, remove studio games\n\nMedia Player Extension:\n- Add SoundCloud, Apple Music, Direct Audio, and LiTT R2 asset adapters\n- Add media API routes: resolve, search, history, playlists, apple token\n- Add Supabase migration for media history and playlists tables\n- Extend MediaHubProvider, MediaExpandedDrawer, and MediaProviderTabs\n- Add 35 tests covering all new providers\n\nLiTT Grounding Fix:\n- Add runtime-context-injector module with deterministic intent routing\n- Inject structured runtime context (repo, branch, terminal, approval, model)\n  into every model request so LiTT reports exact values, not vague summaries\n- Add tool capability manifest — only advertise tools that are actually healthy\n- Route project-status questions to deterministic answer generator (bypasses LLM)\n- Route weather questions to live weather tool before LLM\n- Fix agent selection: LiTT is always default, Spark only when explicitly selected\n- Enforce memory scope separation by agent_mode to prevent context leakage\n- Add precise unavailable-tool error messages (no generic \"I don't have access\")\n- Add 44 tests for intent routing, context injection, and agent selection\n\nStudio Cleanup:\n- Remove duplicate /studio/games route (Solitaire/Sudoku/Wordsearch)\n- Games now live only at /games (Game Cloud + Retro Arcade)\n- Remove Games link from Studio sidebar\n- Fix duplicate .vercel entry in .gitignore\n- Remove leftover temp files (commit-msg-cli.txt, verify-connections.mjs)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
