  "File": "tests/supabase-runtime-crash.test.ts",
  "SymlinkFile": "",
  "Commit": "0629aee268e25151db211921a7f27a9b83b5ee55",
  "Link": "https://github.com/LabsConnected/litlabs-website/blob/0629aee268e25151db211921a7f27a9b83b5ee55/tests/supabase-runtime-crash.test.ts#L164",
  "Entropy": 4.1368423,
  "Author": "Laid-Back-89",
  "Email": "highlife4real1989@gmail.com",
  "Date": "2026-08-02T02:10:45Z",
  "Message": "fix(supabase): prevent runtime crash when NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL is missing (#34)\n\nEMERGENCY PRODUCTION HOTFIX\n\nBug: src/hooks/useSupabaseAuth.ts checked the Supabase anon key but NOT\nthe URL, so createClient(\"\", key) threw \"supabaseUrl is required\" and\ncrashed the homepage at runtime in environments where\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL was missing or placeholder.\n\nFixes:\n1. src/hooks/useSupabaseAuth.ts: getSupabaseClient() now returns null\n   when URL is missing, too short (\u003c10 chars), or not a valid HTTP URL\n2. src/lib/supabase-client.ts: createClient() returns null instead of\n   using non-null assertions that crash on missing env vars\n3. src/hooks/useAgentSubscription.ts: strengthened guard to check URL\n   length and http prefix\n\nAudit of all Supabase initializers in src/:\n- src/lib/supabase.ts getSupabase() — already safe (checks URL + key)\n- src/lib/supabase.ts getSupabaseAdmin() — already safe\n- src/lib/supabase-admin.ts getAdminSupabase() — server-only, throws\n  with clear message (acceptable)\n- src/lib/agent-worker.ts — server daemon, throws with clear message\n- src/hooks/useAgentSubscription.ts — now safe (was partially safe)\n- src/hooks/useSupabaseAuth.ts — now safe (was the crash source)\n- src/lib/supabase-client.ts — now safe (was unsafe, dead code)\n\nTests (tests/supabase-runtime-crash.test.ts — 15 tests):\n- key present + URL missing → no throw, returns null\n- URL present + key missing → no throw, returns null\n- both missing → no throw, returns null\n- URL too short → no throw, returns null\n- URL placeholder (not http) → no throw, returns null\n- both present → client created\n- useSupabaseAuthHook does not crash in any missing-config scenario\n- getSupabase() regression tests\n- useAgentSubscription module loads without crashing\n\nVerification:\n- tsc --noEmit: 0 errors\n- eslint: 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- vitest: 518 passed, 11 skipped, 0 failed\n- build: Compiled successfully\n\nVercel env vars required (Production + Preview + Development):\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY\n- SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (server-only, never NEXT_PUBLIC_)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "0629aee268e25151db211921a7f27a9b83b5ee55:tests/supabase-runtime-crash.test.ts:generic-api-key:164"
 },
