  "Entropy": 3.6818807,
  "Author": "Larry B",
  "Email": "highlife4real1989@gmail.com",
  "Date": "2026-07-30T19:24:44Z",
  "Message": "test: add authorization and preview integration coverage\n\nAdd tests/auth-negative.test.ts — 26 Vitest cases verifying security\nboundaries:\n- Anonymous dev mode is hard-blocked in production even with\n  ALLOW_ANONYMOUS_DEV=true.\n- getMissingRequiredVars reports missing core and production vars.\n- validateEnv never prints secret values.\n- R2 ownership validation rejects cross-user keys, path traversal, and\n  short userIds for getSignedAudioUrl, deleteAudio, deleteBinaryAsset.\n- auth() returns null userId when Clerk has no session and ignores\n  browser-supplied data.\n- PLAYWRIGHT_AUTH_DISABLED bypass is only valid with CI=true,\n  PLAYWRIGHT_TEST=true, and VERCEL absent; the old CLERK_DISABLED flag\n  name is not recognized.\n\nAdd tests/playwright/integration.spec.ts — Vercel Preview integration\ntests: unauthenticated no-500 assertions on public/protected pages and\nAPI endpoints, plus authenticated Clerk tests (User A loads Studio/\nDashboard, User B cannot access User A's project). Authenticated tests\nare skipped unless CLERK_TEST_USER_A/B env vars are set and require\nVERCEL_PROTECTION_BYPASS_SECRET for Deployment Protection bypass.\n\nTighten tests/playwright/studio-smoke.spec.ts to exact status assertions\n(401 for protected APIs, 404 for nonexistent routes) and split into\npublic pages, protected pages, API endpoints, and no-server-errors\ndescribe blocks.\n\nplaywright.config.ts: add preview-integration project gated on real\nClerk credentials in .env.local; strip VERCEL env vars from the local\nwebServer so the test bypass is valid.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "a4f1f3cd9bcda19688e1d192e3acbec5bca9052c:tests/auth-negative.test.ts:generic-api-key:79"
 },
