  "Message": "fix(arcade): improve Lighthouse SEO + deprecated API scores (#20)\n\n* feat: Dashboard V2 with 8 focused cards + rebrand /social to /discover\n\n- Replace 13-widget CommandCenter with DashboardV2 (8 focused cards)\n- Cards: Daily Brief, Continue Project, Current Mission, Unified Inbox,\n  Your World, Recent Work, Community Pulse, System Health\n- Remove AutonomicLoopBanner from dashboard\n- Compact music player in sidebar\n- Mobile-first responsive grid\n- Redirect /social -\u003e /discover (server-side redirect)\n- Rebrand 'LiTT Code' -\u003e 'LiTTree Discover'\n- Remove fake TRENDING counts and ONLINE_AGENTS from social feed\n- Remove fake '50k+ builders' claim\n- Update all /social links to /discover across navbar, footer, navigation,\n  sitemap, dashboard widgets, landing footer, and home page\n- All data fetched from verified server APIs (no fake statuses)\n\n* fix(arcade): improve Lighthouse SEO + deprecated API scores\n\nSEO (66 -\u003e expected 90+):\n- Make /games/retro landing page indexable (was noindex via parent layout)\n- Add proper title, description, keywords, OG, Twitter, canonical metadata\n- Keep /games/retro/play/[gameId] noindex (private game sessions)\n- Add /games/retro to sitemap.ts\n\nBest Practices (81 -\u003e expected 85+):\n- Replace deprecated navigator.userAgent with navigator.userAgentData\n  (with fallback for Firefox/Safari that lack userAgentData support)\n\nNote: CSP and Trusted Types warnings are architectural constraints\n(unsafe-eval needed for EmulatorJS WASM, unsafe-inline for Clerk/Next.js)\nand cannot be fixed without breaking the app.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
