  "Email": "highlife4real1989@gmail.com",
  "Date": "2026-07-28T23:05:04Z",
  "Message": "feat(studio): v12 canonical conversation architecture\n\nServer-owned conversations with Supabase persistence, agent registry,\nmemory service, and project resolver.\n\nCore additions:\n- src/lib/studio/ — server-side studio library\n  - agent-registry.ts: server-owned agent identity resolution\n  - conversation-service.ts: CRUD + revision-based conflict detection\n  - memory-service.ts: Supabase + Supermemory sync\n  - project-resolver.ts: server-side project context\n  - logger.ts: structured studio logging\n  - types.ts: canonical AgentSlug, Conversation, Message types\n\n- src/app/api/studio/conversations/ — REST API\n  - GET/POST /api/studio/conversations (list + create)\n  - GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/studio/conversations/[id] (single + rename + archive)\n  - POST /api/studio/conversations/[id]/messages (idempotent send)\n  - GET /api/studio/conversations/[id]/messages (list)\n  - POST /api/studio/conversations/[id]/regenerate (regenerate assistant)\n\n- src/app/studio/hooks/useCanonicalConversation.ts — client hook\n- src/app/studio/stores/useConversationStore.ts — Zustand store\n- src/app/studio/visual-test/ — visual harness (dev-only)\n\n- supabase/migrations/20260728200000_command_studio_v12_conversations_memory.sql\n  — conversations, messages, memories tables with RLS\n\nFixes:\n- LogContext: added clientRequestId field\n- memory-service: wrapped Supabase query in Promise.resolve for .catch\n- Route handlers: removed default params (Next.js 16 requires non-optional context)\n- Route exports: cast withRateLimit return to satisfy Next.js 16 type checker\n\nVerification: tsc clean, vitest 302/302, build succeeds\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "57313bd74e96f7cd039a94b7530312fcbfa81bbf:src/lib/studio/__tests__/memory-service.test.ts:private-key:75"
 },
