  "Date": "2026-07-27T14:19:56Z",
  "Message": "﻿fix(retro): add diagnostic beacons to iframe config script\n\nAdded two postMessage beacons to the iframe config script to diagnose\nwhy the emulator silently fails:\n\n1. \"config script started\" — fires immediately when the config script\n   begins executing. If the parent never receives this, the iframe CSP\n   is blocking inline scripts.\n\n2. \"loader.js loaded\" — fires when loader.js finishes loading via the\n   script onload handler. If the parent receives #1 but not #2,\n   loader.js failed to load.\n\nAlso fixed a trailing comma syntax error in the first beacon that would\nhave broken the config script (caught by the smoke test).\n\nBump EMULATOR_BUILD_ID to ejs-4.2.3-litt-v8.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
  "Fingerprint": "a1046cd6a570d2e41b822ce7a2c72145d87c1bcf:page.html:generic-api-key:1"
 },
