  "Date": "2026-07-14T04:01:05Z",
  "Message": "feat: navigation and reliability overhaul\n\n- Sidebar sections now navigate when clicked; chevrons separately expand submenus.\n- Navigation compressed into eight predictable areas: Dashboard, Studio, Projects,\n  Agents, Gallery, Marketplace, Social, and More.\n- Added a Projects home base for continuing work, opening code, managing files,\n  agents, and artwork.\n- Removed navigation entries pointing to unsupported pages.\n- Fixed Settings and Marketplace query links to open the correct tabs.\n- Product pages no longer repeat the large marketing footer.\n- Gallery remains visible during temporary API failures instead of disappearing.\n- Demo artwork served from a permanent first-party artwork endpoint, replacing\n  unstable third-party image URLs.\n- Gallery and Games are browsable without forcing sign-in; auth requested only\n  for account actions.\n- Games now have a horizontal artwork carousel, stable covers, truthful license\n  information, and verified playable targets.\n- Fixed local/custom authentication so missing Clerk credentials no longer\n  crash the entire site.\n\nVerification: TypeScript passes, production build passes all 85 pages.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin \u003c158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\u003e",
